    <p class="tag">Specialised Service</p>
    <h1>Unsure Where You Stand With Philippine Immigration?</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">You don't have to walk into a Bureau of Immigration office to find out.</p>

    <p>Share your details with us confidentially, and we'll review your status and explain exactly where things stand — and what, if anything, needs to happen next.</p>

    <h2>A Familiar Situation</h2>
    <p>Foreign nationals lose track of their immigration status for all kinds of reasons: an extension that may not have been filed correctly, records left behind by a previous agent, or simply time passing without a clear picture of what's current. Whatever the reason, the uncertainty itself is often the hardest part — and it's exactly what a confidential review is for.</p>

    <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
    <p>Unresolved immigration status doesn't tend to resolve itself. Left unaddressed, it can lead to fines, additional requirements, and delays the next time you need to extend, travel, or deal with the Bureau of Immigration — complications that are almost always easier to manage the earlier they're identified.</p>

    <h2>How We Can Assist</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reviewing your situation from the passport information and documents you provide — without requiring you to attend a Bureau of Immigration office yourself simply to find out where you stand</li>
      <li>Explaining what your situation means and what options are available to you</li>
      <li>Assisting with the relevant immigration transaction, where the applicable procedure allows representation or document processing on your behalf</li>
      <li>Providing specific instructions if an original travel document needs to be submitted, handled or returned</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>
        <h3>Share your situation</h3>
        <p>Tell us what you know about your status and provide the passport information we request.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Assessment</h3>
        <p>We review the available information and explain what it means for your circumstances.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Next steps</h3>
        <p>We explain the appropriate course of action and assist with the relevant transaction where we are able to.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Ongoing support</h3>
        <p>If an original document is required, we provide specific instructions for its submission, handling and return.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p>We handle the review and coordination remotely wherever the applicable process permits.</p>

    <div class="service-cta">
      <h2>Get Clarity on Your Status</h2>
      <p>Share your situation confidentially and we will help you understand where you stand.</p>
